    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wild Acre Cottage is a charming two-bedroom detached bungalow extending to approximately 75.4 sqm, set on a generous 1.11 acre site on the outskirts of Arklow. Located on the north side of the town, the property enjoys a pleasant countryside setting while offering easy access to the M11 motorway, making it an attractive option for commuters.\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, sitting room with fireplace and wooden surround, fitted galley-style kitchen, two bedrooms, shower room and a particularly spacious conservatory extending to approximately 25 sqm. The conservatory provides excellent additional living space and overlooks the extensive grounds. The property also benefits from off-street parking, oil-fired central heating, mains water supply and a septic tank.\r\nOutside, the generous 1.11 acre site provides excellent space and privacy, while the substantial block-built shed extends to approximately 48 sqm and benefits from both water and electricity, offering excellent storage, workshop or hobby space. Situated just on the outskirts of Arklow, Wild Acre Cottage combines a rural setting with convenient access to the town, local amenities and the M11 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n0.95m x 0.90m\r\n\r\nHall\r\n1.28m x 0.95m\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.19m x 3.33m\r\nLaminate flooring. Fireplace with wooden surround.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.23m x 3.28m\r\nVinyl flooring. Galley-style fitted kitchen with fitted presses.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.08m x 3.28m\r\nVinyl flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.38m x 3.28m\r\nVinyl flooring.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n2.31m x 2.14m\r\nTiled flooring. Fully tiled walls. WC. WHB. Electric shower.\r\n\r\nConservatory\r\n7.25m x 3.48m\r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nRear Lobby\r\n2.32m x 0.90m\r\nDoor to rear garden."
      },
      {
